description: 'Trigger ONLY when the user requests authoring a custom AppSec (CAS/ASPM)
  detection rule from a stated security goal, for infrastructure-as-code misconfigurations
  or for hardcoded secrets in source code. Examples: "create an IAC rule that flags
  public S3 buckets", "write a Terraform guardrail", "add a custom secret rule for
  our internal API keys". Do not activate for policy creation, findings remediation,
  or application grouping.'
